# TypeScript output never belongs in src/ — see tsconfig.json `outDir`
# which sends everything to ../dist. These patterns guard against an
# accidental `tsc` run without `--outDir` (which has bitten us once
# already, producing stale .js files that Vite's @mu/shared alias
# resolved instead of the .ts source on a remote build).
*.js
*.js.map
*.d.ts
*.d.ts.map
